WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.963
Here's what you'll be able to
do by the end of this module.

2
00:00:02.963 --> 00:00:05.973
You'll name the two Graph
permissions the reader needs,

3
00:00:05.973 --> 00:00:08.449
and the role that data
privacy messages need.

4
00:00:08.449 --> 00:00:12.662
You'll say which Graph host
each Microsoft 365 cloud uses,

5
00:00:12.662 --> 00:00:15.350
and why the wrong one fails silently.

6
00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:19.700
You'll map Message center posts and service
health issues to the record's kinds.

7
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.069
You'll tell a date Microsoft set from the

8
00:00:22.069 --> 00:00:24.437
kit's rule for a
prevent-or-fix-issue post.

9
00:00:24.437 --> 00:00:28.226
And you'll show that the kit
refuses a next link on another host.

10
00:00:28.226 --> 00:00:32.157
You need Module 1, for the record
and its action basis, and the intake,

11
00:00:32.157 --> 00:00:36.731
triage and routing chapter of Compliance
Automation and Day-Two Operations,

12
00:00:36.731 --> 00:00:40.663
which explains why nothing is
approved on the strength of an email.

13
00:00:40.663 --> 00:00:44.825
Lab 1 needs PowerShell 7.1
or later with Pester 5.

14
00:00:44.825 --> 00:00:45.820
No tenant.
